# The built binary. The negation matters: this pattern also matches the CLI's
# source directory, which is named after the binary it produces.
**/convert-base-v2
!**/cmd/convert-base-v2/
**/dist
**/bin
# Built by `make -C lib web`, and rebuilt by the pages workflow on every deploy.
/web/convert-base.wasm
/web/wasm_exec.js
**/.vscode/bookmarks.json
**/unicode_visual_debug.png
**/__pycache__

# cicd generated artifacts (run logs, flamegraphs, stray profiles/test binaries)
**/cicd/artifacts
**/*.prof
**/*.test
